matters — for every year, status, senior count, muni and QCD combination, if
there is a phaseout then it is inside the axis drawn for it.

App.test.tsx, new `describe('the torpedo chart's right edge')`: the slider max
and the step intro at $150,000 / $175,000 / $250,000, the explainer sentence
flipping, and the axis not retreating behind a parked slider.

App.chart.test.tsx: the three single-filer cliff lines sliding left by exactly
