### Verified

`npx tsc -b`, `npx eslint src --max-warnings 0`, `npx vitest run` (7 files, 455
tests, green in 4.4s), `npm run build`. No CSS change.

### Logged, not fixed

Two Discovered Work bullets: the narrower-axis question above, and that
App.chart.test.tsx is the one suite that never pins the clock — it runs on 2026
