tax.test.ts: `giftEnd` at zero, at the gift, clamped by the statutory limit,
doubled on a joint return, and pushed out by the gain; the axis widening from
$150,000 to $250,000 on the no-benefit joint case that has nothing else to
widen it; and the property — for every year, status, senior count, muni and
