tests, green in ~5s), `npm run build`. No CSS change.

### Logged, not fixed

One Discovered Work bullet: at the extreme the chart's first 43% is a flat run
at nothing. It is honest — that run is exactly what the gift buys — but it may
be a worse teacher than a sentence would be. Options are capping the axis and
marking the gift off-chart the way the IRMAA cliffs already are, breaking the
axis, or leaving it.

Note also that the existing "a gain crowds out the gift" bullet gets more
reachable with this change: the summary line still names the gift the reader
