  rest at 20px/20px, `.step + .step` at 1px `rgb(74,80,89)` = `--edge-strong`,
  no horizontal scroll at 1440 or 420, zero page errors.
- Under `emulateMedia({ media: 'print' })` at 1440 and at 701: 30 tick values,
  3 SVGs, grid `--edge`, axis `--edge-strong`, ticks `--ink-muted`, body
  `rgb(28,28,34)` on white, **zero** elements anywhere on the page still
  painted a dark background, zero elements wider than the sheet, and the
  checked segmented option drawn as an accent border with no fill.
  Screenshotted step 2 and the close at paper width and read them.

### Left standing, and why

Everything App.tsx writes from `PALETTE` prints in its screen colour — the
