### The tree opened two thirds through this task, and red

`1f03ccc` was HEAD, in sync with `origin/dev`, and the working tree held six
modified files: `PAGE_TAX_YEAR` added to `tax.ts`, the two-button Tax Year strip
cut out of step 1, `changeYear` deleted, and `year` gone from `PageScenario` and
